{"id":786506,"title":"03｜零基础搭建第一个智能体：语音汇报小秘书","content":"本文介绍了如何快速搭建一个汇报小秘书AI助手，该助手能够自动阅读行业新闻、总结内容并通过语音播报。首先，在国内某AI智能体平台上注册并登录，创建一个名为“汇报小秘书”的应用助手。接着为助手添加技能：一是使用浏览器页面操作工具访问并读取网页内容；二是利用微软文本转语音服务将文本转换成语音。通过测试发现，助手可以准确地从指定URL中提取文章内容，将其概括成简短的要点，并以语音形式输出。此外，还展示了如何进一步扩展助手功能，使其能够将总结后的文本及语音文件发送至指定邮箱，从而实现更加便捷的信息获取与分享。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392033,"user_name":"一鸣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2573931,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"A01D44A9A951F4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/27/46/6b/6c26c731.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1719797097,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142635,"content":"哦哦？","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1719027,"ctime":1720787655,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":392033,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"引流。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/3a/f3/106ff941.jpg","nickname":"周文洋","note":"","ucode":"61D85493E804D1","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647937,"discussion_content":"哦哦？","content_length":3,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1720787655,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":392032,"user_name":"一鸣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2573931,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"A01D44A9A951F4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/27/46/6b/6c26c731.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1719796585,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142634,"content":"哈哈。被你发现啦。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_rea